{"api-response-toasts":"<div class=\"grid gap-x-10 gap-y-6 lg:grid-cols-2\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-4\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1\"><h5 class=\"text-base font-bold\">API Response Toasts</h5><p class=\"text-sm text-neutral-400\">displayToastWithApiResponse reads an Infinite API envelope and picks the tone from the status code: 207 is a partial success, 400 and above is an error, anything else is a success.</p></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2\"><a href=\"https://github.com/goinfinite/ui/blob/main/src/display/toast.templ\" rel=\"help noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"View Complete Component Settings\"><h4 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-neutral-50 transition-all hover:opacity-80\">Usage <i class=\"ph-bold ph-arrow-square-out text-sm text-neutral-400\"></i></h4></a><pre class=\"rounded-md bg-neutral-800 p-4 text-xs text-wrap break-words tab-2\"><code>$store.toast.displayToastWithApiResponse(apiResponse, httpStatusCode)\n$store.toast.displayToastWithApiResponse({readableMessage: &#34;Server rebuilt&#34;}, 200)</code></pre></div></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3\"><p class=\"text-lg font-bold\">Live Example</p><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2\" x-data><!-- Button --><div class=\"relative w-fit\"><button type=\"button\" @click=\"$store.toast.displayToastWithApiResponse({readableMessage: &#39;Server rebuilt successfully.&#39;}, 200)\" class=\"w-fit bg-emerald-500 hover:bg-neutral-50/12.5  p-1.5 py-2 text-sm gap-0.75 text-neutral-50 hover:text-neutral-50 rounded-md  justify-center items-center text-center font-bold flex flex-row leading-none transition-all\"><i class=\"ph-bold ph-check text-base\"></i>  200 Success </button> </div><!-- Button --><div class=\"relative w-fit\"><button type=\"button\" @click=\"$store.toast.displayToastWithApiResponse({readableMessage: &#39;Two of three records imported.&#39;}, 207)\" class=\"w-fit bg-yellow-500 hover:bg-neutral-50/12.5  p-1.5 py-2 text-sm gap-0.75 text-neutral-50 hover:text-neutral-50 rounded-md  justify-center items-center text-center font-bold flex flex-row leading-none transition-all\"><i class=\"ph-bold ph-warning text-base\"></i>  207 Partial Success </button> </div><!-- Button --><div class=\"relative w-fit\"><button type=\"button\" @click=\"$store.toast.displayToastWithApiResponse({readableMessage: &#39;Record name is required.&#39;}, 400)\" class=\"w-fit bg-red-500 hover:bg-neutral-50/12.5  p-1.5 py-2 text-sm gap-0.75 text-neutral-50 hover:text-neutral-50 rounded-md  justify-center items-center text-center font-bold flex flex-row leading-none transition-all\"><i class=\"ph-bold ph-x text-base\"></i>  400 Error </button> </div></div></div></div>","mount-settings":"<div class=\"grid gap-x-10 gap-y-6 lg:grid-cols-2\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-4\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1\"><h5 class=\"text-base font-bold\">Mount Settings</h5><p class=\"text-sm text-neutral-400\">AutoDismissSeconds sets how long each toast stays up; it defaults to 10 seconds. The background defaults to neutral-800/90. The ring defaults to the tone color: green for success, yellow for partial success, red for danger. BackgroundColor, TextColor, RingThickness, RingColor, and Radius accept Tailwind tokens. Mount one Toast per page: the mount configures the shared toast store.</p></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2\"><a href=\"https://github.com/goinfinite/ui/blob/main/src/display/toast.templ\" rel=\"help noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"View Complete Component Settings\"><h4 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-neutral-50 transition-all hover:opacity-80\">Usage <i class=\"ph-bold ph-arrow-square-out text-sm text-neutral-400\"></i></h4></a><pre class=\"rounded-md bg-neutral-800 p-4 text-xs text-wrap break-words tab-2\"><code>@uiDisplay.Toast(uiDisplay.ToastSettings{\n\t// OptionalFields\n\tAutoDismissSeconds: 6,\n\tTextColor:          &#34;neutral-50&#34;,\n\tSize:               uiDisplay.ToastSizeMd,\n\tRingThickness:      uiToolset.RingThicknessMd,\n\tRadius:             uiToolset.BorderRadiusMd,\n})</code></pre></div></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3\"><p class=\"text-lg font-bold\">Live Example</p><p class=\"text-sm text-neutral-400\">The live example above already mounts a styled toast with a 6 second auto-dismiss. Every button on this page uses that mount.</p></div></div>"}
